# What this module is

Main Phone and Tablet application for Universal Installer.
An advanced package manager and APK sideloading tool supporting standard PackageInstaller,
Shizuku, Dhizuku (Device Owner), and Root. Features include batch uninstallation, VirusTotal security analysis,
split APK installation (APKS, XAPK, APKM), and TV/Watch sync.
`install` always means writing an application package onto this device, never "set up an account".

Resources are split by domain for maintainability (each under 350 lines):
- `strings.xml`: Core brand, navigation tabs, shared buttons & generic alerts.
- `strings_install.xml`: Install card/sheet, install prompt, engine modes, OBB, VirusTotal, and profiles.
- `strings_manage.xml`: Manage apps, batch actions (disable, stop, clear data), permissions, and backups.
- `strings_settings.xml`: Preferences, themes, language, root/shizuku modes, parental controls, and about info.
- `strings_sync.xml`: TV sync, Watch sync, remote transfers, and local web downloads.

## Audience & tone

Direct second-person, clear and technical yet accessible.
Keep dialog actions and button labels compact enough to fit single lines on 360dp screens.
Use direct register: `vi` uses "bạn" (never "quý khách"), `pt-BR` uses "você".

## Do not translate

- Shizuku
- Dhizuku
- Dex2oat
- VirusTotal
- Universal Installer
- UniversalInstaller
- Google Play
- microG Companion
- APKM
- API

